    "Name": "Partisan AAA (LC)",
    "Details": "The Partisan Air Defense Tank (Lance Command) is a significant upgrade designed to engage and destroy Clan fighters. The older ICE was replaced by a fusion engine. Its armor was replaced with  Ferro-Fibrous Armor, drastically increasing its protection. A C3 Master Unit provides for better coordination with the rest of its unit, increasing accuracy. Finally, its weapons complement was replaced with twin UAC-5’s partnered with a pair of Autocannon/2s for long range fire.\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Biome Restrictions: None.</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Movement: 3/5 hexes / 90/150 meters.</color></b>\n\n<color=#ffcc00><b>Armor:</b> Ferro-Fibrous\n<b>Structure:</b> Structure\n<b>Values       A        S  </b>\n<b>Front</b>       200     40\n<b>Left</b>         150     40\n<b>Right</b>       150     40\n<b>Rear</b>        105     40\n<b>Turret</b>      200     40\n\n<b>Total</b>      805    200</color>\n\n<color=#ff0000>Quirk: Anti-Air Targeting</color>",
    "Icon": "Partisan"
  },
